+| Configuration implementation and research | `gpt-6-luna` / `max` | `gpt-6-luna` / `max` | `openai` | `/root/configure_agents`, `01a10688-d438-7f31-8298-200f866b8f02` | `01a10685-5bf3-7470-b7de-183c04711b16` |
